      "title": "Metal spring prototype",
      "text": "Print two PETG parts. Fit sensor and 6.5 x 1 mm silicone pad. Place three 7 mm metal spacer sleeves and compression springs on the foot, slide socket ears over sleeves, fit washers and M2 x 12 screws into foot pilots. Screws clamp sleeves, never moving ears. Spring geometry is illustrative: select low-rate springs and bench-test contact/release. See README for dimensions and limitations."
